{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608250/extras/7b1a85aa9fe3a6567e0ec1832a7ace26.avif?t=1768517462\" width=1080 height=560 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dodge Deadly Lasers in First Person</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist sci-fi levels are packed with laser drones that guard  soda cans. Learn their patterns and watch your footing to avoid getting impaled by heated spikes. Try different routes and strategies while honing your reflexes.\u00a0Learn to dance with the lasers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Items to Power Up and Unlock the Exit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through each level by collecting the required amount of Suga soda cans. They have the added effect of boosting your speed and jump height with each pickup, allowing you to zip past lasers with more ease and reach previously inaccessible areas. Golden pull tabs  add time to your countdown timer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive for a Chance to Win a Sweet Payout</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a  world where sugar addiction is widespread and sugar shortages drive up the price of sugary drinks, you find yourself signing up for Laserade - Suga Corp's annual contest for promoting their soft drink brand in which many perish for a chance to win $1M and unlimited soda.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3608250?t=1768517462","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608250/ef64114432b683f6bf6da3563f525745cce4dc43/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768517462","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608250/d535db5d21e8e114f48d62e5d293f850d0a5137f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768517462","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608250/d535db5d21e8e114f48d62e5d293f850d0a5137f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768517462","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608250/extras/7b1a85aa9fe3a6567e0ec1832a7ace26.avif?t=1768517462\" width=1080 height=560 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dodge Deadly Lasers in First Person</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist sci-fi levels are packed with laser drones that guard  soda cans. Learn their patterns and watch your footing to avoid getting impaled by heated spikes. Try different routes and strategies while honing your reflexes.\u00a0Learn to dance with the lasers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Items to Power Up and Unlock the Exit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through each level by collecting the required amount of Suga soda cans. They have the added effect of boosting your speed and jump height with each pickup, allowing you to zip past lasers with more ease and reach previously inaccessible areas. Golden pull tabs  add time to your countdown timer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive for a Chance to Win a Sweet Payout</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a  world where sugar addiction is widespread and sugar shortages drive up the price of sugary drinks, you find yourself signing up for Laserade - Suga Corp's annual contest for promoting their soft drink brand in which many perish for a chance to win $1M and unlimited soda.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","developers":["Design Boy"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608250/49097522047777dca9d0ab63f4ec9c4c02e493bf/header.jpg?t=1768517462","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[